  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "64",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 64"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "64",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mie ibet kipsengwetisiek, ak ichoruge, si kobiit kobotanso tulonok eng’ taing’ung’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ko u ye beelei mat sigorik, ak ko u ye iguuti mat beek: si kibarta kaineng’ung’ konaak eng’ buniguk, si kobotanso bororiosiek eng’ taing’ung’! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye kingiyai tuguk che bo kamuiset che kima kicheng’, kiichoruge, kibotanso tulonok eng’ taing’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu tomo kogas bik koboch keny, anan koguiyo eng’ itik, anan kogeer eng’ konyekwak Kamuktaindet age ne ma inye, ne yaei boisiet agobo chito ne igeni inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otuitosi ak inendet ne baibai ak koyaei imanda, icheget che ibwatin eng’ ortinweguk: keero, kiinerech, ak kigiyai tengekto: kigeyai choto betusiek che chang’, ak tos kisoruech? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kigiige tugul chi ne bo simdo, ak u imandanyo tugul ngoriet ne muruon: ak kirestosi achek tugul ko u sogot; ak onech yaitwogikyok ko u ye onsei usonet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama mi ne kuurei kaineng’ung’, ne igiilegei si kobiit konamin: amu kiiung’enech togeng’ung’, ak kiigeswech amu tengekwogikyok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara anyun, ee Jehovah, i kwandanyo; ki menet, ak ko i mimiindennyo; ak ki boisionikab euneguk achek tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amat inerech mising’, ee Jehovah, amat ibwat tengekto agoi: keero, keer komie, kisain, ki biguk achek tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigoek kong’atet nganasoguk che tililen, koek Sion ong’atet, koek Jerusalem karatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigebeel gonnyo ne tilil ne kararan, ole kilosunenen kwanisiekyok; kigong’emogis tugukyok tugul che kororon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Jehovah, tos ta iranyege eng’ tuguchoto? Tos isise, ak inyalilech mising’?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
